  "question": {
    "text": "Two projectiles are projected at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>with the horizontal with the same speed. The ratio of the maximum height attained by the two projectiles respectively is:",
    "image": null
  },
